<title>UK: Euromarket turnover fell in week to Feb 27 - ISMA.</title>
<headline>Euromarket turnover fell in week to Feb 27 - ISMA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turnover in Eurobond and related markets fell to $1.021 trillion in the week to February 27 from 1.046 trillion the previous week, International Securities Market Association data showed (in billions of dollars):</p>
<p>					  Latest week	Previous week</p>
<p> Primary market:		     57.43		63.90</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues     29.36		32.45</p>
<p> Secondary market:		  963.60	     982.28</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues    226.85	     209.08</p>
<p> Cleared through Euroclear	757.07	     764.13</p>
<p> Cleared through Cedel	    263.96	     282.05</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
